id: explosive-performance
name: Explosive Performance
order: 7
optionOf: show-stopping-performance
optionEffect: 1
description: >
  When using the Hype Maneuver, if your last Maneuver was an Attacking Maneuver, reduce the Life Points of the Opponent(s) hit by that Attacking Maneuver by your Personality Modifier and 1/2 (rounded up) of your Might.
text: >
  Explosive Performance [Triggered, 1/Round]: When using the Hype Maneuver, if your last Maneuver was an Attacking Maneuver, reduce the Life Points of the Opponent(s) hit by that Attacking Maneuver by your Personality Modifier and 1/2 (rounded up) of your Might.

---

# The Hype Maneuver used: the Opponents your last Maneuver hit - read before the Hype is written over it - their Life
# Points less your Personality Modifier and half your Might (chat.mjs explosivePerformance). Nobody, not spent. Automatic
# by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/hype, 1/round, effect 1]
explosivePerformance();
